# Apple天气增强
# 解锁Apple天气的全部功能、替换空气质量数据源、添加下一小时降水数据、添加天气数据。
# author: VirgilClyne[https://github.com/VirgilClyne], WordlessEcho[https://github.com/WordlessEcho], 001[https://github.com/001ProMax]
# homepage: https://hub.kelee.one
# icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luestr/IconResource/main/App_icon/120px/AppleWeather.png
# date: 2026-06-01 17:11:35
# lpx: https://kelee.one/Tool/Loon/Lpx/AppleWeatherEnhancer.lpx
# converted: Loon .lpx -> Stash .stoverride (auto) v2
# note: kelee.one resources require Loon UA; if Stash fetch fails, add proxy or use GitHub mirror
name: Apple天气增强
desc: 解锁Apple天气的全部功能、替换空气质量数据源、添加下一小时降水数据、添加天气数据。
icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luestr/IconResource/main/App_icon/120px/AppleWeather.png
rules:
- DOMAIN,weather-analytics-events.apple.com,REJECT-DROP
- DOMAIN,tether.edge.apple,REJECT-DROP
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tthr.apple.com,REJECT-DROP
- AND,((OR,((IP-ASN,714,no-resolve),(IP-ASN,6185,no-resolve))),(PROTOCOL,QUIC)),REJECT-DROP
script-providers:
  response-bundle:
    url: https://github.com/NSRingo/WeatherKit/releases/download/v3.1.0/response.bundle.js
    interval: 86400
  response-bundle-1:
    url: https://github.com/NSRingo/WeatherKit/releases/download/v3.1.0/response.bundle.js
    interval: 86400
http:
  mitm:
  - weatherkit.apple.com
  script:
  - match: ^https?:\/\/weatherkit\.apple\.com\/api\/v1\/availability\/
    name: response-bundle
    type: response
    require-body: true
    argument: '[ColorfulClouds,ColorfulClouds,EU_EAQI,,devapi.qweather.com,,,Argument,WARN]'
  - match: ^https?:\/\/weatherkit\.apple\.com\/api\/v2\/weather\/
    name: response-bundle-1
    type: response
    require-body: true
    binary-body-mode: true
    argument: '[ColorfulClouds,ColorfulClouds,EU_EAQI,,devapi.qweather.com,,,Argument,WARN]'
